(7445276, 1177458, 163081, '<td valign="top">I was born left handed, but learned to use both hands to do things. Most of the time I will use my left hand to draw. I use scissors or cutting tools, computer,  etc... with my right hand. In an other entry where I drew something I used my right hand because I had the ruler in my left. I am not ambidextrous. There are things I just cannot do with one or the other hand. <br/>It was great fun making this. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I was born left handed, but learned to use both hands to do things. Most of the time I will use my left hand to draw. I use scissors or cutting tools, computer,  etc... with my right hand. In an other entry where I drew something I used my right hand because I had the ruler in my left. I am not ambidextrous. There are things I just cannot do with one or the other hand. It was great fun making this.  ', '2016-03-21 10:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
