(7445449, 1177506, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FromDaRock:</b></div><hr/><i> Very creative idea, definitely going to help your score.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately the image suffers from some overall sharpness issues. and could use some minor rotating CCW.  I think if the technicals were better, this would be a top 5 image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So much for that comment!  Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Originally posted by FromDaRock: Very creative idea, definitely going to help your score. Unfortunately the image suffers from some overall sharpness issues. and could use some minor rotating CCW.  I think if the technicals were better, this would be a top 5 image.   So much for that comment!  Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2016-03-22 16:13:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445484, 1177506, 60581, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FromDaRock:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FromDaRock:</b></div><hr/><i> Very creative idea, definitely going to help your score.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately the image suffers from some overall sharpness issues. and could use some minor rotating CCW.  I think if the technicals were better, this would be a top 5 image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So much for that comment!  Congratulations on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Even looking at numbers I was expecting it to be in top 5 or 6 but of course 2nd is the best :)</td>', 'Originally posted by FromDaRock: Originally posted by FromDaRock: Very creative idea, definitely going to help your score. Unfortunately the image suffers from some overall sharpness issues. and could use some minor rotating CCW.  I think if the technicals were better, this would be a top 5 image.   So much for that comment!  Congratulations on the ribbon!   Even looking at numbers I was expecting it to be in top 5 or 6 but of course 2nd is the best :)', '2016-03-22 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
